            "text": [
              "KCE celebrates a wide range of national, cultural, and festive occasions throughout the year, including <b>Independence Day, Republic Day, Teachers’ Day, Engineers’ Day, National Youth Day, International Women’s Day, Pongal, Onam, Navaratri, and Christmas Celebrations,</b> fostering a vibrant and inclusive campus community.",
              "Through active participation and event organization, students develop leadership, teamwork, creativity, and communication skills, making campus life an enriching and joyful part of their holistic development.",
              "The vibrant campus culture not only rejuvenates students but also enriches their educational journey, creating an environment where <b>learning, talent, celebration, and togetherness go hand in hand.</b>"
